### User Management API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json

### Variables - Will be set from responses
@userId = 

###
### List All Users
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### Create New User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john.doe@example.com",
  "password": "securePassword123",
  "role": "ROLE_USER"
}

###
### Create New Admin User
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "name": "Admin User",
  "email": "admin@familyplan.local",
  "password": "admin123",
  "role": "ROLE_ADMIN"
}

###
### Get User by ID (replace {userId} with actual UUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### Get User Points Balance (replace {userId} with actual UUID)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/{{userId}}/points
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

###
### Get User by ID - Not Found (should return 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
